    "display_name": "Card Styling Challenge",
    "long_instructions": "# Card Styling Challenge\r\n\r\n**Your Task:** With the help of AI, improve how the content cards look and feel.\r\n- Before saving your changes, resize the preview to check how the cards behave on smaller screens. If images stretch, spacing breaks, or elements overlap, refine your CSS to improve the layout.\r\n\r\n### Plan Before You Prompt\r\n\r\nBefore you ask AI to make changes, write:\r\n- **Goal:** What specific part of the card are you improving?\r\n- **Constraints:** What must stay consistent with your brand and the rest of the page?\r\n- **Edge cases:** What could go wrong if AI overdoes it?\r\n\r\nMake one request at a time (one area, one fix), then preview before asking for the next change.\r\n\r\nThis can include:\r\n- Borders and corners (border shape and color)\r\n- Shadows (consistent shadows and elevation)\r\n- Spacing (padding inside cards, gap between elements)\r\n- Image fit (no stretching; consistent shape)\r\n\r\n:::details [Need Help Prompting AI]\r\nIf you would like help crafting your AI prompt or deciding whether to accept, revise, or reject the output generated by AI, you can refer to the [Prompting Playbook](https://studio.code.org/docs/ide/prompting-playbook).\r\n:::",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Improve the look of content cards. ",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/81685e6a3a6cc9bebd7ab8a6101f4467-website-design.png",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Volunteer Board — Card Styling Challenge</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n      <h1 class=\"brand\">Volunteer Board</h1>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Primary\">\n        <ul class=\"nav\">\n          <li><a href=\"#env\">Environment</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#tutor\">Tutoring</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#events\">Events</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n    <section class=\"hero container\">\n      <h2>Find a way to help this month</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Pick a project, bring a friend, make an impact.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"cards container\" aria-label=\"Opportunities\">\n      <!-- Card 1 -->\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/forest/560/340\" alt=\"Forest clean-up\" />\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <h3>Trail Clean-Up</h3>\n          <p>Join the weekend crew to remove debris and mark new paths in the north woods.</p>\n          <div class=\"tags\">\n            <span class=\"tag\">Environment</span>\n            <span class=\"tag\">Outdoors</span>\n          </div>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#join-1\">Join Us</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <!-- Card 2 (longer text) -->\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/library/420/500\" alt=\"Library tutoring\" />\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <h3>Library Tutoring</h3>\n          <p>Support elementary students with reading and homework. Materials provided; training on day one.</p>\n          <div class=\"tags\">\n            <span class=\"tag\">Tutoring</span>\n            <span class=\"tag\">After School</span>\n          </div>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#join-2\">Join Us</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <!-- Card 3 -->\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/community/720/280\" alt=\"Community event\" />\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <h3>Community Festival</h3>\n          <p>Help set up booths and guide visitors. Great for first-time volunteers.</p>\n          <div class=\"tags\">\n            <span class=\"tag\">Events</span>\n          </div>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#join-3\">Join Us</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <!-- Card 4 -->\n      <article class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/foodbank/500/300\" alt=\"Food bank\" />\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <h3>Food Bank Packing</h3>\n          <p>Sort and pack donations for local families. Lifting required; bring closed-toe shoes.</p>\n          <div class=\"tags\">\n            <span class=\"tag\">Food</span>\n            <span class=\"tag\">Logistics</span>\n          </div>\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#join-4\">Join Us</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"site-footer container\">\n      <p>© 2025 Volunteer Board</p>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "styles.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml,\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  background: #f6f7fb;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  display: block;\n}\n\nh1,\nh2,\nh3 {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n}\n\na {\n  color: #16a34a;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.container {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 1080px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 16px;\n}\n\n.site-header {\n  background: white;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n}\n\n.header-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 16px 0;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.nav {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 16px;\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.nav a {\n  color: #1f2937;\n}\n\n.hero {\n  padding: 24px 0;\n}\n\n.lede {\n  color: #6b7280;\n}\n\n.cards {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n  gap: 16px;\n  padding: 24px 0;\n}\n\n/* Cards still need visual improvement:\n   - square corners\n   - no padding\n   - no shadow\n   - stretched images\n   - cramped tags and button */\n\n.card {\n  background: white;\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n.card > img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 160px;\n  object-fit: fill;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n}\n\n.card-body {\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.card h3 {\n  margin: 6px 0 4px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card p {\n  color: #6b7280;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  margin: 0 0 6px;\n}\n\n.tags {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 4px;\n  margin: 4px 0;\n}\n\n.tag {\n  border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  padding: 2px 4px;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0;\n  border: none;\n  background: none;\n  color: #16a34a;\n  text-align: left;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  margin: 4px 0;\n}\n\n.site-footer {\n  border-top: 1px solid #d1d5db;\n  padding: 24px 0;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #6b7280;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
